xt":"Free cash flow was $1.5 billion in FY2026: operating cash flow of $1.5 billion less capital spending of $22 million (computed from two filed figures). That is 30.5% of revenue. In FY2021 it was $700 million.","cites":["GEN.ocf.2026","GEN.capex.2026","GEN.revenue.2026","GEN.ocf.2021","GEN.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $237 million in FY2026, 4.7% of revenue, against 3.2% in FY2021.","cites":["GEN.sbc.2026","GEN.revenue.2026","GEN.sbc.2021","GEN.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $634 million to repurchase its own shares and $312 million in dividends: $946 million together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["GEN.buybacks.2026","GEN.dividends.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-10-02 revenue was $1.4 billion, up 12.2% from $1.2 billion in the three months ended 2025-10-03.","cites":["GEN.d.revenue.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","GEN.d.revenue.2025-07-05.2025-10-03"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-10-02 revenue added up to $5.2 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $2.2 billion and net income to $1.2 billion.","cites":["GEN.d.revenue.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","GEN.d.revenue.2025-03-29.2026-04-03","GEN.d.revenue.2025-03-29.2026-01-02","GEN.d.revenue.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","GEN.d.revenue.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","GEN.d.opinc.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","GEN.d.opinc.2025-03-29.2026-04-03","GEN.d.opinc.2025-03-29.2026-01-02","GEN.d.opinc.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","GEN.d.opinc.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","GEN.d.netinc.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","GEN.d.netinc.2025-03-29.2026-04-03","GEN.d.netinc.2025-03-29.2026-01-02","GEN.d.netinc.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","GEN.d.netinc.2026-07-04.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $1.8 billion: operating cash flow of $1.8 billion less capital spending of $16 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["GEN.d.ocf.2025-03-29.2026-01-02","GEN.d.ocf.2025-03-29.2025-10-03","GEN.d.ocf.2025-03-29.2026-04-03","GEN.d.ocf.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","GEN.d.ocf.2026-04-04.2026-10-02","GEN.d.capex.2025-03-29.2026-01-02","GEN.d.capex.2025-03-29.2025-10-03","GEN.d.capex.2025-03-29.2026-04-03","GEN.d.capex.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","GEN.d.capex.2026-04-04.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $1.3 billion at the end of FY2026, against $1.3 billion a year earlier. That is 26.4% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["GEN.rpo.2026","GEN.rpo.2025","GEN.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.9 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $1.8 billion a year earlier.","cites":["GEN.deferred.2026","GEN.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 3,900 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $1.3 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["GEN.q.employees","GEN.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $35 million, after $7 million in FY2025.","cites":["GEN.restructuring.2026","GEN.restructuring.2025"]}]},"fin":{"GEN":{}},"quotes":{"GEN.q.employees":{"c":"GEN","kind":"employees","n":3900,"quote":"•General Employee Demographics: As of April 3, 2026, we employed approximately 3,900 team members across more than 20 countries.","source":"GEN-0000849399-26-000017","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-05-21","proof":"a38274c0eca55dcaf0ff63d0cdf1305bf4d76e94fdfb6b067144d59a161655a0"}}}